    &KIND C
      BASIS_SET cc-pVQZ-GTH-q4
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q4
    &END KIND
    &KIND H
      BASIS_SET cc-pVQZ-GTH-q1
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q1
